<li>**三大专业标准**：MOHURD 城市设计管理办法、MOHURD 控规编制审批办法、MNR 用地分类指南，已在 <code>standard_matrix.json</code> 中建立映射 <span class="evidence evidence-standard">[standard:MOHURD-URBAN-DESIGN-MEASURES]</span><span class="evidence evidence-standard">[standard:MOHURD-CONTROL-DETAILED-PLANNING]</span><span class="evidence evidence-standard">[standard:MNR-LAND-USE-CLASSIFICATION-202311]</span></li>
